{
  "what": "The host serial-port inventory `agentic-hil init` and `agentic-hil setup` build their COM-port advice from, on the kind of host #549 was reported on: a stock Ubuntu 24.04 lists its 32 legacy `/dev/ttyS*` ports first, with no USB identity, and the one port a board is on, the on-board debugger's virtual COM port, last. Recorded rather than typed, so the order the advice samples from and the fields it tells a USB port by are the host's own.",
